      "value": "@{5fd6607b5088a057bd89d26a|full_name}: Ahh, so it would be similar to bootsector games from way back in the day. Super small size, can be loaded near instantly, and didn't take a lot resources while loading: https://youtu.be/1UzTf0Qo37A\nI like this idea, since a lot of people with slow download speeds likely get bored in the loading screen. And also people with hypersensitivity to loud noises or crazy visuals have a quick way to escape.",
