  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I love the idea to have a Local home, that kinda like a fallback space, where if you load worlds, crash, or just want to be alone for a bit, you can call your local home at any time, it should have a limit so it loads fast, and you can add things to wait while the next world loads, or while you wait for a friend in a world, almost like having two worlds open, your personal pocket dimension. \nFeel Free to ad other ideas to the post!",
